+- `afterModelResponse` is called once per user message after the round loop exits and receives the sum of usage reported by every provider call in that turn; a turn with no tool calls retains exactly the usage its single provider call reported ([validated by: reports usage summed across every provider call in a two-tool-round turn](../../src/orchestration/usageAcrossToolRounds.acceptance.test.ts#L40)).
+- Usage across rounds is combined by summing input, output, and total tokens element-wise ([validated by: sums tokens when both arguments carry usage](../../src/orchestration/orchestratorHelpers.test.ts#L35)).
