+- When no provider call in a turn reports usage, the hook receives `undefined` ([validated by: returns undefined when nothing has been accumulated](../../src/orchestration/orchestratorHelpers.test.ts#L43)).
+- When the accumulator is empty and a round reports usage, that usage seeds the total ([validated by: seeds from incoming usage when accumulator is empty](../../src/orchestration/orchestratorHelpers.test.ts#L47)).
